{"sourceUrl":"https://civil.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/24019.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:48.966356+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://civil.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/24019.html","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>欢迎优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读北京交通大学土木建筑工程学院硕士、博士研究生。我校推免生只招收全日制。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.获得推荐学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.身心健康，符合规定的体检要求。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>说明：</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请人获得所在学校推免生资格</span></span></span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>如所在学校尚未完成推免资格评定工作，但预计可取得推免生资格者，也可申请</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span><span>，最终拟录取结果以学生是否具有推免资格及复试成绩等决定。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>二、申请材料</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.有效居民身份证；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.学信网学籍在线验证报告；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.本科成绩单，要求加盖学生所在学校教务处公章；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文、出版的专著等）、国家英语四（六）级成绩单、获奖证书等；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.申请直接攻读博士研究生者（直博生）还须提供《直博生个人陈述表》（附件1）、两位申请攻读学位学科领域内的教授（或相当专业技术职称）专家的《直博生专家推荐书》（附件2）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>以上申请材料由考生在我校推免预报名系统上传电子版图片，可通过对原件进行扫描或拍照生成，上传电子版为</span><span>pdf或jpg格式，每个附件大小不超过1M。申请人必须保证全部申请材料以及网上报名信息的真实性和准确性。如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消申请人推免录取资格，并通报申请人所在学校，责任由申请人自负。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>招收专业如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>代码</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>名称</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是否接收硕士推免</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是否接收直博生推免</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>081400</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>土木工程</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>082301</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>道路与铁道工程</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>085901</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>土木工程（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>否</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>08590</span></span><span><span><span>0</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>土木水利（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>否</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>086100</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>交通运输（专业学位）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>是</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>三、申请考核流程及要求</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.申请</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>1）申请时间：9月8日</span></span></span><span><span><span>00：01</span></span></span><span><span><span>至</span><span>9月11日</span></span></span><span><span><span>23：59</span></span></span><span><span><span>，申请人登录北京交通大学研究生院招生专题网的</span><span>“推免预报名系统”（网址：https://gsadmission.bjtu.edu.cn/recommend/signin/）进行预报名，按系统要求填写报名信息并上传申请材料，每个申请人只能填报一个志愿。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”9月21日9：00开通，如开通时间有变化，以最终实际开通时间为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.现场确认</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span>凡现场参加过土建学院</span><span>7月10日“2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动”，无需现场确认。</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>其他通过报名材料审核并确认参加推免考核的学生，</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>请于</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日下午</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>14</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>:</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>00</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>17</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>:</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>00</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>到土木建筑工程学院土木工程楼一层大厅现场确认。并提交以下材料（均用</span><span>A4纸张）：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>1）《北京交通大学招收</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）研究生申请表》（报名系统中下载，考生可持该表进入校园）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>2）有效居民身份证复印件，空白处签字(原件查验)；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>3）学信网学籍在线验证报告；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>4）本科成绩单，要求加盖学生所在学校教务处公章；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>5）英语水平证明材料复印件（原件查验）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>6）出示报名系统中下载的《个人陈述表》、《登记表》，工作人员将在考核登记表上盖章（面试前把此两个表交给面试秘书）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>7）申请直接攻读博士研究生者（直博生）还须再提供《直博生个人陈述表》（附件1）、两位申请攻读学位学科领域内的教授（或相当专业技术职称）专家的《直博生专家推荐书》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>以上第（</span><span>1）~（5）项材料按顺序装订在一起（在左上角装订一枚订书针即可），全部申请材料恕不退还。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3、考核要求</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>1）考核形式：凡参加过我院7月10日“2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动”的学生，可以采取网络面试的形式；其他学生采取现场面试的形式。每生时间一般20分钟（具体时间关注后续通知）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>2）考核时间：2026年9月17日（具体时间关注后续通知）。并根据考核结果确定后续补录考核工作。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>3）考核内容：考核内容包括外语能力测试、专业及综合能力测试两部分。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>外语能力测试主要考查考生的外语听力及口语水平。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span><span><span><span><span><span>专业及综合能力测试主要考查考生大学阶段学习情况及成绩；对本学科（专业）理论知识和应用技能掌握程度；利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力；对本学科发展动态的了解以及在本专业领域发展的潜力；创新精神和创新能力；思想政治素质和道德品质；本学科（专业）以外的学习、科研、社会实践（学生工作、社团活动、志愿服务等）或实际工作表现等方面的情况；事业心、责任感、纪律性（遵纪守法）、协作性；心理健康情况；人文素养；举止、表达和礼仪等。</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4、考核成绩评定</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>考核成绩满分为</span></span></span><span><span><span>100</span><span>分。考核总分低于</span><span>60</span><span>分为不及</span></span></span><span><span><span>格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>分值构成：外语</span><span>20分，专业和综合能力测评80分。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>5、录取接收</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>1）学院择优录取，确定拟录取名单，拟录取生须按照我院要求在规定时间内确定是否接收待录取，未在规定时间内完成确认的推免生，学院将不再保留其拟录取资格，相应依次递补拟录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>2）所有拟录取学生在规定时间登录国家教育部“推免服务系统”，完成注册、填写个人基本信息、上传照片、网上支付、填写志愿、确认待录取等步骤，网报专业须与拟录取专业一致。未在规定时间内完成确认的推免生，学院将不再保留其拟录取资格，相应依次递补拟录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>3）推免生一旦在教育部“推免服务系统”接受待录取通知，则不可再接受其它志愿的待录取通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>4）拟录取的推免生不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生考试招生，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>5）</span></span><span><span><span>同分考生录取规则：在同一专业内，若考生总成绩相同，</span></span></span><span><span><span>优先</span></span></span><span><span><span>录取</span></span></span><span><span><span>专业和综合能力</span></span></span><span><span><span>较高的考生。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>四</span></strong></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><strong><span>、学费和奖助学金</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>我校按照国家和北京市的规定收取研究生学费。我校设有多项研究生奖助学金，具体申请要求和流程以学生手册为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>五</span></strong></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><strong><span>、其他</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.未通过教育部“推免服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）确认的推免录取结果，一律无效。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.推免生接收工作结束后，推免生拟录取名单将在研究生院招生专题网（网址：https://yzb.bjtu.edu.cn/index.htm）公示，公示时间不少于7日。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>六</span></strong></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><strong><span>、联系方式</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>办公地址：北京交通大学土木工程楼</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span><span>层</span><span>723</span></span></span><span><span><span>室</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>网站：</span></span></span><a href=\"http://civil.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span><span><span><u><span>http://civil.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/</span></u></span></span></span></u></a></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span>xczh</span></span><span><span><span>@bjtu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>010-51685313</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>联系老师：张老师</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>通信地址：北京市海淀区北京交通大学土木建筑工程学院研究生科，邮政编码：</span></span></span><span><span><span>100044</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>                              <span>土木建筑工程学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>2026.09.0</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h4>附件：</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://civil.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2026/09/20260907184114_13.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1-附件1：直博生个人陈述表.doc</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://civil.bjtu.edu.cn/media/attachments/2026/09/20260907184114_622.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1-附件2：直博生专家推荐书.doc</a>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"f1c3cb2143549ce1340794e75fe78f763c11575836ba8043e3ec1191b542351d","textLength":2597,"sourceSha256":"f13877bcd7f5669bbf6138110ef1a36760dbfa6c0536f350728a4b78c7d3ec61","selector":".article-content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a13f0c37123cd48caa8f","title":"2026年北京交通大学土木建筑工程学院2027年招收推荐免试攻读硕士（博士）研究生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:48.966356+00:00"}
